 ## `section.bin`

-### Version 118 (current release)
+### Version 119 (current release)
+
+Complete sections use version 119 and partial sections use `0xE8`. Heading words remain bold even when publisher CSS or nested spans specify normal weight. Bold glyph widths can change wrapping, so both complete and suspended layouts rebuild once; reading progress and clippings are preserved.
+
+### Version 118

 Complete sections use version 118 and partial sections use `0xE7`. Block-styled spans can affect pagination. In the optional per-word font-size byte, bits 0–5 store the point size, bit 6 marks a black background on the preceding space, and bit 7 hides the glyphs while retaining their layout width.

